        "content": "<p>cfallin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14405\">PR #14405</a> from <code>cfallin:combined-v48</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:release-48.0.0</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Do not drop fuel-spend accrued by callees of <code>call_ref</code> and callees that<br>\n  return via exception throws.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-m63x-6p34-q65x\">GHSA-m63x-6p34-q65x</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix fuel spend for dynamic record lifting.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-jqpg-j7w6-42pr\">GHSA-jqpg-j7w6-42pr</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix host memory exhaustion on outgoing HTTP body write.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-c9gc-w9vx-w86p\">GHSA-c9gc-w9vx-w86p</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>wasmtime-wasi: Fix panic on out-of-range datetimes in WASI filesystem set-times, set-times-at.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-j2g9-4prp-pf6h\">GHSA-j2g9-4prp-pf6h</a><br>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
